# Unpublished site data (kept local, not for public repo).
# Two exceptions are published deliberately: LMSH001.CNT and its PCount
# report LM23SH00.RPT back the golden validation test, so that the claim
# "reproduces PCount output to the digit" is independently reproducible.
# One sample of twenty; the rest of the site stays private.
/inst/extdata/LMSH*.CNT
!/inst/extdata/LMSH001.CNT
